UID:tgng8vreb3f4g5qsqgm20kkjmo@google.com
CREATED:20150420T021832Z
DESCRIPTION:Guess what's right around the corner? The 7th Annual Jacksonvil
 le Craft and Import Beer Festival !! \n\nThe largest beer festival in North
  Florida will be at the Jacksonville Veterans Memorial Arena on Friday\, Ma
 y 15th\, from 5pm–9pm.\n\nVeterans United Craft Brewery is going to be ther
 e with our bells on and our taps full of cold\, delicious\, local craft bee
 r\, so make plans to join us for a fabulous night downtown.\n\nGeneral Admi
 ssion tickets are $45 and VIP tickets are $60. Everyone will get to roam ar
 ound and sample all kinds of awesome beer and food throughout the evening.\
 n\nFor more information and to purchase general or VIP tickets\, visit: htt
 p://www.beerfestjax.com/\n\nWe'll see you there!
LAST-MODIFIED:20150420T021832Z
LOCATION:Jacksonville Veterans Memorial Arena\, 300 A Philip Randolph Blvd\
 , Jacksonville\, FL\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:EVENT: 7th Annual Jacksonville Craft & Import Beer Festival 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
