UID:0lm3bk4rgjfaurhtb6cj79kglk@google.com
CREATED:20141015T204142Z
DESCRIPTION:LAST DAY!!\n\nFrom October 1st–31st\, the Military Working Dog 
 Team Support Association\, Inc. (MWDTSA)\, a nonprofit organization support
 ing U.S. military dogs and their handlers\, will launch the 2014 KONGs for 
 K­9s supply drive with small business partners across the nation.\n\nVetera
 ns United will be collecting large Kong toys at the taproom to send to our 
 four-footed warriors overseas to aid in their training and R&R. We will be 
 accepting donations of Large KONG Classics\, Large KONG Biscuit Balls\, Lar
 ge KONG Goodie Bones\, and Large KONG Extremes. The KONGs will be matched b
 y a free Kong Classic toy or KONG Extreme from the KONG Company. The donate
 d toys will be sent in care packages to deployed dog teams overseas\, and t
 he matched toys are used during visits to kennels at stateside bases. \n\nF
 or every toy you donate\, take $1 off any size growler fill. We know we hav
 e a lot of wonderful dog-lovers out there\, so thank you in advance for you
 r contribution to some awesome pups. \n\nShare this with your buddies and h
 elp us send a great big box of these treats to our furry friends by the end
  of the month!
LAST-MODIFIED:20141015T204142Z
LOCATION:Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western Way #104\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL 32256\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:KONGS for K9s Collection Ends
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
