CREATED:20141009T165415Z
DESCRIPTION:http://jaxtoberfest.com/\n\nVeterans United is now selling tick
 ets to the Burgers and Beer Party benefiting the Greater Jacksonville Flori
 da Area USO. \n\nThese exclusive tickets includes general admission to Jaxt
 oberfest on Friday the 10th (4–11pm)\; access to the USO's private VIP tent
  from 6–8pm\; samples of a variety of burgers and Veterans United beer\; an
 d entertainment by the U.S. Navy Band. Each ticket is $40\, or $35 for mili
 tary personnel or veterans. \n\nThe local USO chapter is 100% self-funded t
 hrough the donations of the local citizens and corporations. They receive n
 o federal\, state\, nor city funding as well as no direct funding from Unit
 ed Way. Help us give back a little in exchange for some great fill-your-bel
 ly fun this Friday.\n\nPlease check with our bar servers in the taproom for
  tickets if you'd like to join us and contribute to a great cause.\n\nWe wi
 ll also be serving up some Veterans United brews at The Flight Party\, bene
 fiting the USS Adams on Friday night.\n\nEach patron will receive food and 
 beer to pair from local restaurants and will receive a flight paddle with 4
  commemorative beer sampler glasses.
LAST-MODIFIED:20141009T165415Z
LOCATION:The Shipyards\, 750 E. Bay St\, Jacksonville\, FL 
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:EVENT: Jaxtoberfest
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
