DESCRIPTION:SATURDAY\, OCTOBER 4TH\nTickets to Oktoberfest on Saturday\, Oc
 tober 4th from 12:00pm to 8:00pm include a souvenir Oktoberfest stein\, a f
 ree stein fill\, a giant pretzel\, live oompah music and other entertainmen
 t.\nFood is NOT included but there will be a variety of food trucks parked 
 on-site serving German fare!\n$35 in advance\n$40 CASH at the door\nKids un
 der 12 free\n\nHighlights of both Friday and Saturday’s festivities include
 :\n\nTHE SWINGING BAVARIANS OOMPAH BAND\n\nTraditional Oktoberfest songs\, 
 yodeling\, slap-dancing and more!\nCheck out their awesomeness at www.swing
 ingbavarians.com.\n\nBEERS\nGerman brews from Intuition Ale Works\, Aardwol
 f and Veterans United will be flowing!\n\nFOOD\nYour ticket includes a gian
 t pretzel made by Mellow Mushroom.\n\nWe’ve partnered up with Jax Truckies 
 and will have multiple food trucks on-site\, each serving at least one Germ
 an dish. Stay tuned for details on which food trucks will be participating!
 \n\nTRADITIONAL BEER COMPETITIONS\n\nDetails and ticket info: http://mempar
 kjax.org/event/oktoberfest-memorial-park/
LAST-MODIFIED:20140929T154351Z
LOCATION:Memorial Park Association\, Inc.\, 1620 Riverside Ave\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:EVENT: Oktoberfest at Memorial Park
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
