CREATED:20141024T213521Z
DESCRIPTION:SPECIAL FOR TONIGHT ONLY!\n\nCome on down to the taproom and ev
 ery time you purchase a pint\, have your name entered to win a pair of tick
 ets to the awesome Navy League Chalet at the NAS Jax Air Show 2014 tomorrow
 ! The experience includes access to a nice shady tent where you will have s
 pectacular views right next to the flight line! Throw in some barbecue and 
 a few pints of Veterans United beer\, and you're livin' it up in style!\n\n
 Winners will be drawn tonight at closing and will be notified via email. Ev
 eryone who purchases a pint at the taproom tonight is eligible to win ONE p
 air of tickets. You will be able to pick up the tickets at the taproom begi
 nning at 11:30am tomorrow morning. The Blue Angels fly at 3pm\, so you'll h
 ave plenty of time to view everything else this great event has to offer.
LAST-MODIFIED:20141024T213521Z
LOCATION:Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western Way #104\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL 32256\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TICKET GIVEAWAY! Tonight Only!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
