UID:7okmekla0b8874v9j2l6croafj@google.com
CREATED:20191003T142145Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>Love solving puzzles?&nbsp\;...with friends?&nbsp\;...while 
 eating and drinking?</b><br><br><b>Join us for Puzzled Pint!</b><br><b><br>
 </b><br><b>Puzzled Pint is a casual\, social puzzle solving event which hap
 pens at bars/pubs on the second Tuesday of every month in multiple cities a
 round the world. The Friday before each event\, we post a location puzzle t
 o this website. The solution to that puzzle will lead you to a local pub/ba
 r/restaurant in your city. Hints will be available here on the site.</b><br
 ><b></b><br><b>On the night of the event\, show up at the specified pub in 
 your city (some cities may offer a choice\; details including event start t
 ime will be posted on the locations page). We'll have more puzzles for you 
 to solve while you enjoy drinks and food. Most teams take between 30 minute
 s and 2 hours to solve a typical puzzle set. "Game Control" will be on hand
  to give hints and verify answers.</b>
LAST-MODIFIED:20191003T142145Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Taproom: Puzzled Pint Night (Open to all)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
