 cj27eodjtm4caej
CREATED:20180529T135311Z
DESCRIPTION:\nOPEN TO ALL INTERESTED IN THE CLUB\nVision & Purpose\n\nThe V
 eterans Beer Club's (VBC) vision is a monthly rotation of gatherings with f
 ellow veterans\, current transitioning service members\, and members of the
  Jacksonville business community at different brewery location across the g
 reater Jacksonville area. The VBC purpose is to discuss important transitio
 n events and continued service after military life while enjoying the craft
  beer in a relaxed environment. The Jacksonville community avidly supports 
 veterans – non-profit organizations and local businesses alike seek to hire
  or help veterans assimilate into the community. The VBC believes that supp
 orting\, vetting\, and assisting noteworthy organizations legitimately help
 s veterans and the community at large.  Lastly\, we hope to interface with 
 senior veterans in the community -who paved the way before us- and leverage
  their passion for assisting fellow veterans.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts:
  https://hangouts.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/ZXFqM3N0NW4wNWY2ODRvNDVva2
 g2OTV0dXNAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ.35jn6nnp5a2cj27eodjtm4caej?hs=
 121
LAST-MODIFIED:20180529T135754Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Veterans Beer Club Jacksonville (Inaugural Meeting)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
