UID:74gkaqluf5jvrh67esa1eblb8c@google.com
CREATED:20140910T023107Z
DESCRIPTION:Come drink and draw! \nOr drink and just watch! \nOr drink and 
 try to ignore the whole thing! (Betcha can't!)\n\nFor September's Drink and
  Draw!:\nModel: Ramona Rhapsody\nDemonstrating Artists: \n1. Christina Boyk
 in of Boykin Art Studio\n2. Minda Artforyourlife\n3. Ryan Gunwitch-Black\n\
 nVenue features: Local craft beer from Jax's newest brewery Veterans United
  Craft Brewery! Raging Blonde Ale\, Scout Dog 44\, Hop Banshee\, and more! 
 Wine and soda also available and Pele's Mobile Pizza Oven food truck outsid
 e! No cover or fee but please order a brew or two to show this new local br
 ewery how much Jax loves craft beer!\n\nPresented by Boykin Art Studio\, th
 is will be a regular monthly event at different watering holes around Jax w
 here there is always a beautiful model posing for three local artists who a
 re demonstrating their talents for your viewing pleasure. Art supplies are 
 provided for those who want to join the fun but bringing your own is welcom
 ed and encouraged!\n\nJoin here: https://www.facebook.com/events/6667688134
 19122
LAST-MODIFIED:20140910T023107Z
LOCATION:Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western Way #104\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Drink & Draw!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
