UID:3r95f2i2t6cpi415qob92g4us8@google.com
CREATED:20190911T192100Z
DESCRIPTION:VU Brew Mug Club Membership Renewals / Waiting List\n\nThe VU B
 rew Mug Club renewals and waiting list are now officially open! \n\nThe wai
 ting list is for those who are not currently members of the VU Brew Mug Clu
 b but really wanna join! \n\nCurrent VU Brew Mug Club members have through 
 August 31st to renew their memberships.\n\nOpen VU Brew Mug Club spots left
  after August 31st will be given to people on the waiting list based on the
  order in which they signed up. \n\nThe annual membership fee is $75 and we
  ask that you come in to the taproom to have your name added to the waiting
  list. \n\nThe new VU Brew Mug Club year starts October 1st.\n\nBenefits of
  VU Brew Mug Club membership includes an assigned # mug in the taproom that
  holds an extra 4 ounces of beer (20oz vs 16oz pint) and access to VU Brew 
 Mug Club-exclusive events and specials.  \n\nFYI - Super SWEET deal for our
  MUG CLUB Members ONLY:\n\nYou get to try our Beer Releases and Small Batch
  beers EARLY on Tuesdays! 🍻\n\nAn empty VU Brew Mug is a SAD VU Brew Mug! 
 \n\n"Rikki Don't Lose That Number" ---- Steely Dan  \n\nEXCEPTIONS --> To o
 ur military personnel who are currently deployed or away for duty or traini
 ng\, please contact us if wish to be added to the waiting list or if you ar
 e already an existing VU Brew Mug Club member and we'll hold your mug for y
 ou!
LAST-MODIFIED:20190911T192100Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Last day for MUG CLUB renewals!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
