UID:g3iig55crh2kodfm6ul2menn7c@google.com
CREATED:20141015T204051Z
DESCRIPTION:From October 1st–31st\, the Military Working Dog Team Support A
 ssociation\, Inc. (MWDTSA)\, a nonprofit organization supporting U.S. milit
 ary dogs and their handlers\, will launch the 2014 KONGs for K­9s supply dr
 ive with small business partners across the nation.\n\nVeterans United will
  be collecting large Kong toys at the taproom to send to our four-footed wa
 rriors overseas to aid in their training and R&R. We will be accepting dona
 tions of Large KONG Classics\, Large KONG Biscuit Balls\, Large KONG Goodie
  Bones\, and Large KONG Extremes. The KONGs will be matched by a free Kong 
 Classic toy or KONG Extreme from the KONG Company. The donated toys will be
  sent in care packages to deployed dog teams overseas\, and the matched toy
 s are used during visits to kennels at stateside bases. \n\nFor every toy y
 ou donate\, take $1 off any size growler fill. We know we have a lot of won
 derful dog-lovers out there\, so thank you in advance for your contribution
  to some awesome pups. \n\nShare this with your buddies and help us send a 
 great big box of these treats to our furry friends by the end of the month!
LAST-MODIFIED:20141015T204051Z
LOCATION:Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western Way #104\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL 32256\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
