UID:9i1ljitel4e141c6q0d51b2c5s@google.com
CREATED:20140929T153832Z
DESCRIPTION:Hey\, Ospreys! Veterans United will be celebrating with you by 
 pouring delicious craft beer samples this Saturday at the 2014 Ozzie's Okto
 berfest in the Coxwell Amphitheater at the Student Union\, from 7–9pm.\n\nM
 usic & entertainment will be led by polka-masters\, The Swinging Bavarians.
  The mouth-watering bounty will be catered by On the Fly Sandwiches & Stuff
 \, Chunky Tomato\, Blue Pacific Grill & Taco Bar\, Driftwood BBQ\, and Funk
 adelic Food Truck. In the spirit of Oktoberfest\, UNF Campus Life decrees a
 ll grub and beer will be free. I'll repeat: IT'S ALL FREE!\n\nThe event is 
 open to students (must present a valid Osprey1Card\; 21+ year-olds may part
 ake in the beer ozzomeness) and you may bring one guest.\n\nGet ready for a
  one great party and we'll see you there!\n\nEvent info: https://www.facebo
 ok.com/events/1481872348749387/
LAST-MODIFIED:20141015T180811Z
LOCATION:University of North Florida\, 1 University of North Fl Dr\, Jackso
 nville\, FL\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:EVENT: UNF Ozzie's Oktoberfest
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
