RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/New_York:20150204T150000
CREATED:20140918T152306Z
DESCRIPTION:Come one\, come all! \n\nMike Young\, the local games represent
 ative for ZMan Games\, will be here with some fun games to demo and play wi
 th anyone who wants to join in.\n\nSome titles he will have available will 
 include: \n\nAkrotiri :: Blueprints :: Camel Up! :: Carcassonne (New Editio
 n) :: Carcassonne: Gold Rush :: Pandemic :: Pandemic: The Cure ( aka Pandem
 ic Yahtzee) :: Pandemic: Contagion (card based\, players are diseases) :: P
 arade :: Russian Railroads :: Terra Mystica :: Terra Mystica: Fire & Ice ::
  Tichu :: Zooroletto Dice\n\nHe'll teach any games or run demos on a first-
 come\, first-served basis.\n\nSign up for the Meet-Up here: http://www.meet
 up.com/jax-board-and-card-games/events/219910475/\n\nOr just stop by after 
 work for some great beer and good times!
LAST-MODIFIED:20160803T140648Z
LOCATION:Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western Way #104\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL\, United States
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beer Bingo
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
