DTEND:20150227T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261117T024549Z
UID:9t9etekt1t4ovib2j6gllpme0o@google.com
CREATED:20150213T040619Z
DESCRIPTION:Eddie Fink and his restaurant friends\, who have been supportin
 g the fight against hunger with an annual fundraising event in Jacksonville
  for more than 20 years\, have created a new event – 3 Squares – to support
  Feeding Northeast Florida (FNEFL). \n\nMore than 50 of the area’s top chef
 s and restaurants are taking part in the event\, scheduled for 6:30 p.m. Th
 ursday\, Feb. 26\, 2015 at the Prime Osborne Convention Center’s Grand Lobb
 y. \n\nTickets are $70 per person and can be purchased at http://www.feedin
 gnortheastflorida/events.org or by calling 904-201-4416. \n\n3 Squares will
  feature local restaurants\, beverage distributors\, and caterers engaging 
 in a friendly competition showcasing their signature dishes. In addition to
  the fabulous food and spirits\, a local band will provide live entertainme
 nt. One hundred percent of all proceeds will be used to fight hunger in the
  community.\n\nVeterans United is proud to be a supporter of this awesome e
 vent.
LAST-MODIFIED:20150213T040619Z
LOCATION:The Prime F. Osborn III Convention Center\, 1000 Water Street\, Ja
 cksonville\, FL 32204\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:EVENT: 3Squares Fundraiser
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
