DESCRIPTION:If you haven't had the opportunity to check out our awesome bre
 wery and try a pint\, now's your chance. Grab your friends and join Veteran
 s United and Bottle & Bottega for a great time! This is a pick your paintin
 g event and you'll be able to pick one of two images to paint.\n\nYour tick
 et also includes all paint supplies\, step by step instruction from a local
  artist\, use of an apron and a 16x20 take-home canvas. You also get a flig
 ht of delicious craft beer!\n\nCheck-in & Reception begins at 6:30pm -this 
 is the perfect time to enjoy your sample flight of beer and get ready to un
 leash your creativity. Painting takes place from 7:00pm-9:30pm.\n\nAttendan
 ce is for adults 18 and over only. Alcohol consumption is permitted only fo
 r adults over 21. Please have an ID available.\n\nCancellations made within
  48 hours are subject only to a Bottle & Bottega studio credit. Sorry\, the
 re will be no credits or refunds for “no shows.”\n\nWe can't wait to see yo
 u there!\n\nTickets: http://bit.ly/1EvoWoq
LAST-MODIFIED:20150417T190735Z
LOCATION:Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western Way #104\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL\, United States
