DESCRIPTION:\nOur REINDEER ROCKET RAUCHBIER is an intriguing\, complex and 
 delicious libation imparting warm and toasty MALTY notes as well as SMOKY a
 roma and flavor in the traditional style!\n\n\n\n\nRauchbier originates in 
 Bamberg where the malt is smoked over beechwood\, instilling a smooth and p
 leasant smoky flavor\, which transfers into the beer. \n\n\n\n"Rauch" is Ge
 rman for "smoke."\n\n\n\nGet a pint and maybe you'll be taking off with Rud
 olph!
