DESCRIPTION:OKTOBERFEST VIP PREVIEW PARTY FRIDAY\, OCTOBER 3RD\nWe are sell
 ing a limited number of tickets to our VIP Preview Party* on Friday\, Octob
 er 3rd from 6pm to 9pm!\n\nTickets are $125\, exclusive to Memorial Park As
 sociation Donors* and include all-you-can-eat authentic German fare catered
  by Sausage Paradise\, a souvenir Oktoberfest stein\, three locally-brewed 
 Oktoberfest beers\, a giant pretzel by Mellow Mushroom\, live oompah music 
 and more!\n\n9/18/2014: The Memorial Park Association is pleased to announc
 e that all VIP Party ticket holders will also be admitted to Saturday’s eve
 nt at no additional charge.\n\n*Please note\, the VIP Preview Party is excl
 usive to Memorial Park Donors only. For details see below. \n\nTo be admitt
 ed Saturday\, all VIP Party ticket holders must bring their beer stein and 
 wear their wrist pass from the night before. Although\, admittance on Satur
 day does not include items offered with a ticket purchase\,  you can still 
 enjoy steins full of beer for just $5 and support Memorial Park.\n\nDetails
  and ticket info: http://memparkjax.org/event/oktoberfest-memorial-park/
LAST-MODIFIED:20140929T154404Z
LOCATION:Memorial Park Association\, Inc.\, 1620 Riverside Ave\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:EVENT: Oktoberfest VIP Preview Party at Memorial Park
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
