DESCRIPTION:<span style="color: rgb(51\, 51\, 51)\; font-family: &quot\;Ope
 n Sans&quot\;\, Helvetica\, Arial\, sans-serif\; font-size: 16px\; backgrou
 nd-color: rgb(244\, 246\, 242)\;">Join Joel Graves\, owner of American Surv
 ival Co.\, competitor on Discovery Channel’s Bushcraft Build-off and Retire
 d EOD for Seal Team 2 &amp\; 4 to learn about survival mentality and tips f
 or surviving emergency situations\, whether it’s urban or wilderness. Joel 
 draws on his own experiences in Afghanistan\, Bahrain\, and Iraq\, as well 
 as providing secret service protection for 2 presidents around the globe\, 
 and then living off the land for 5 months to discuss how you can be better 
