UID:87cs32el784se33ejgc5tgtq90@google.com
CREATED:20150131T030820Z
DESCRIPTION:https://www.facebook.com/riversidecraftbeerfest\n\nhttp://river
 siderotaryjax.org\n\nThe Second Annual Riverside Craft Beer Fest will be he
 ld on February 28\, 2015 from 1pm until 6pm under the Fuller Warren Bridge 
 in Jacksonville\, FL. Veterans United is proud to be a participant in this 
 year's event.\n\nLive music featuring The Corbitt Brothers Band and Grandpa
 's Cough Medicine!\n\nAll proceeds from this event will benefit the Riversi
 de Rotary Foundation which is currently building a track at Stockton Elemen
 tary. We also use these funds to give College Scholarships at UNF and suppo
 rt other endeavors in the Jacksonville area.\n\nThere will be a VIP Section
  where a ticket will be required to enter. The VIP area will be catered (an
 nouncing the caterer soon!) and have some special beers for this area only.
 \n\nA 7oz pour will cost 1 ticket. All tickets will cost $2.00 and this is 
 a cash only event. There will be 2 ATMs on site and VyStar Credit Union is 
 across the street as well.\n\nThere will be a Special Tapping Tent\, where 
 every hour different Breweries will be offering a special beer for a limite
 d time. (When the keg floats or 1 hour maximum whichever comes first.) Thes
 e beers will be either hard to find or higher ABV content or maybe both. Be
 ers at this tent will cost 2 tickets.\n\nVIP Tickets include:\n12oz Souveni
 r Acrylic Mug (Refills outside of the VIP Tent cost the same price as the n
 ormal beer tickets\, but get a 12oz pour rather than a 7oz pour)\n4 Beer Ti
 ckets\nVIP Area Only Beers\nBest View of Stage outside of the stage seating
  area\nFenced Area under a tent with tables and chairs\nCatered Food to be 
 determined from a local Riverside/Avondale Restaurant to be determined\nVIP
  Area beer ticket sale table with no lines!\nVIP Schwag Bag\n\nVIP Tickets:
  https://www.eventbrite.com/e/2015-riverside-craft-beer-fest-featuring-the-
 corbitt-brothers-band-and-grandpas-cough-medicine-tickets-14706578773
LAST-MODIFIED:20150310T200450Z
LOCATION:Riverside Arts Market\, Riverside Avenue\, Jacksonville\, FL\, Uni
 ted States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FESTIVAL: Riverside Craft Beer Festival
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
