DESCRIPTION:Are you ready for Gastrofest 2015? Jacksonville will be celebra
 ting its fabulous culinary diversity and deliciousness in a big way with ta
 stes\, talks\, films\, and workshops on Saturday\, March 21st\, in and arou
 nd Hemming Park from 11am–10pm.\n\nThe BeerApostle\, Brian Little\, and Jam
 es Moriarty\, head brewer at Veterans United Craft Brewery\, will be hostin
 g a fun and educational workshop to share their thoughts on the growing loc
 al craft beer scene and talk beer basics so you can get your start as a pro
 ud home brewer.\n\nThe Gospel of Brew Sessions will take place at 11:30am a
 nd 12:30pm during Gastrofest at Down The Rabbit Hole\, 42 West Monroe Stree
 t (next to Grease Rags Clothing Co.).\n\nCheck out the guys here during an 
 appearance of the most recent episode of iKnowJAX.com: https://www.youtube.
 com/watch?v=P_6tR_jkA5k&t=163\n\nFor more information about Gastrofest and 
 all the cool happenings going on throughout the day\, follow their event pa
 ge: https://www.facebook.com/events/946179225395156/
LAST-MODIFIED:20150310T200356Z
LOCATION:Down the Rabbit Hole\, 42 W Monroe St\, Jacksonville\, FL 32202
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:FESTIVAL: Gastrofest\, The Gospel of Brew Sessions (11:30a & 12:30p
 )
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
