DESCRIPTION:Our special small batch feature this Valentine's week is our Si
 zzlin' Hot Chocolate Stout. This light-bodied oatmeal stout was aged on ric
 h cocoa nibs and a tasty blend of mild\, spicy\, and smoked chili peppers. 
 The complex depth of flavor\, subtle heat\, and luscious aroma makes this b
 eer one to truly go mad over.\nWe'll tap the delicious keg and pass out fre
 e samples to all the lucky peeps in the taproom at 5pm today.\nCome on down
  and grab a pint of this dynamite beer while it lasts!
