CREATED:20150210T040035Z
DESCRIPTION:https://www.facebook.com/UncleMaddiosDeerwood\n\nSaturday Febru
 ary 21st Only!!!\n\nUncle Maddio’s Pizza Joint is excited to offer this spe
 cial deal to our VU customers:\n\nAny Medium Pizza$12.99\nAny Large Pizza$1
 4.99\n\nCall Uncle Maddio’s to place your pizza order & they will deliver i
 t to you at the VU Taproom\n\nOrder before 1:30pmDelivery at 2:00pm\nOrder 
 before 2:30pmDelivery at 3:00pm\nOrder before 3:30pmDelivery at 4:00pm\nOrd
 er before 4:30pmDelivery at 5:00pm\nOrder before 5:30pmDelivery at 6:00pm\n
 \n** This delivery offer applies to pizza only **\n\n\n8221 Southside BlvdJ
 acksonville\, FL 32256\n(904) 527-8605\n\n\nCREATE YOUR OWN PIZZA. YOU CHOO
 SE THE DOUGH\, SAUCE AND TOPPINGS.\nDOUGH: Traditional\, Whole Wheat\, Glut
 en Free\nSAUCE: Tomato-Basil\, Zesty BBQ\, Buttermilk Ranch\, Spicy Buffalo
 \, Herb Pesto\, Olive Oil\nCHEESES: Mozzarella\, Cheddar\, Goat Cheese\, Ri
 cotta\, Feta\, Blue Cheese\, Daiya Vegan Cheese\nMEATS: Anchovies\, Bacon\,
  Canadian Bacon\, Chicken Apple Sausage\, Grilled Chicken\, Grilled Angus S
 teak\, Ground Beef\, Ham\, Italian Sausage\, Meatballs\, Pepperoni\, Spicy 
 Sausage\, Turkey\, Jerk Chicken\nVEGGIES: Artichoke Hearts\, Banana Peppers
 \, Basil\, Black Bean Corn Salsa\, Black Olives\, Broccoli\, Caramelized On
 ions\, Celery\, Cilantro\, Corn\, Eggplant\, Garlic\, Green Olives\, Green 
 Peppers\, Grilled Tofu\, Mandarin Oranges\, Mushrooms\, Pickled Jalapenos\,
  Pineapple\, Portabella Mushrooms\, Red Onions\, Spinach\, Sundried Tomatoe
 s\, Tomatoes\, Zucchini\nSIGNATURE PIZZAS\n\nBBQ CHICKEN: zesty bbq & tomat
 o-basil sauce\, mozzarella and cheddar\, grilled chicken\, bacon\, red onio
 ns\, corn and cilantro\nTHE GREEK: tomato-basil sauce\, organic baby spinac
 h mozzarella and feta cheese with red onions\, black olives\, and artichoke
  hearts tossed in greek dressing\nSPICY ITALIAN: tomato-basil sauce\, mozza
 rella\, spicy italian sausage\, red onions\, mushrooms\, banana peppers and
  fresh basil\nCHICKEN CLUB: buttermilk ranch dressing\, mozzarella & chedda
 r\, grilled chicken\, bacon\, roma tomatoes and lettuce\nTHE BIG MAX: tomat
 o-basil sauce\, mozzarella\, pepperoni\, italian sausage\, bacon\, handmade
  meatballs\nBUFFALO CHICKEN: spicy buffalo and tomato-basil sauce\, mozzare
 lla\, grilled chicken\, blue cheese crumbles\, celery and homemade ranch\nS
 IMPLY VEGGIE: tomato-basil sauce\, mozzarella\, roma tomatoes\, banana pepp
 ers\, zucchini\, mushrooms\, black olives and fresh basil\nJAMAICAN JERK: t
 omato-basil sauce\, mozzarella\, grilled jerk chicken\, red onions\, green 
 peppers\, pineapples and cilantro\nPORTOBELLO PESTO: herb pesto sauce\, moz
 zarella \, portabella and white mushrooms\, feta cheese\, roma tomatoes and
  fresh basil\nSTEAK & BLUE: olive oil\, mozzarella\, blue cheese crumbles\,
  grilled angus steak\, roma tomatoes\, garlic\, spinach\, fresh basil and b
 alsamic glaze\nSOUTHWEST BAJA: tomato-basil sauce\, mozzarella and cheddar\
 , sw spice\, grilled chicken\, black bean corn salsa\, jalapeños\, cilantro
  and sour cream\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150221T013719Z
LOCATION:Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western Way #104\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL 32256\, United States
