BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20141205T230000Z
DTEND:20141206T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20261117T024549Z
UID:l08sqmcv808evfu8sacqj2fo3o@google.com
CREATED:20141126T210023Z
DESCRIPTION:Veterans United Craft Brewery is reviving the spirit of celebra
 tion for the day that marked the repeal of the 18th Amendment by hosting a 
 Post-Prohibition Party at the taproom. \n\nJoin us for a rollickin' good ti
 me as we feature a set of bootlegging bluegrass from Canary in the Coalmine
  and the best guitar\, banjo\, and fiddle players of Caint Never Could. Smo
 ke It Up Barbecue Food Truck will be here with an array of classic\, smoked
  meats that will perfectly pair with the small batches being tapped for the
  occasion. \n\nWe will release Bootleg Ale\, brewed from an old American al
 e recipe using six-row barley\, rye malt\, corn\, wheat\, and a generous ad
 dition of old-recipe molasses\; and The O. G. Lager\, a golden beauty brewe
 d from a pre-Prohibition-style recipe with six-row barley\, corn\, and crys
 tal malt\, and fermented at a nice\, cool temperature.\n\nEveryone who dons
  their best flapper and dandy duds may be entered in our raffle drawing to 
 win a growler of one of these limited brews. We'll also have a bunch of nif
 ty photo props set up near the brewery viewing area\, so snap a photo\, tag
  us on Facebook\, Twitter or Instagram with #VUBREW\, and show us your best
  swilling pose in honor of the 21st Amendment.\n\nThere's no secret passwor
 d or cover required for this evening. Just grab some friends\, shake a leg\
 , and hustle down the winding path of Western Way for some great music\, ta
 sty BBQ\, and cool craft beer. Invite your friends and RSVP here to keep in
  tune with all the latest updates on this shindig.\n\n---\n\nGents and dame
 s: don't forget to designate a driver! New Uber app users can use the code 
 VUBREW to receive $20 off your first ride.\n\nJoin with Google Hangouts: ht
 tps://hangouts.google.com/hangouts/_/talk.google.com/taproom-arvid?hceid=ZX
 FqM3N0NW4wNWY2ODRvNDVva2g2OTV0dXNAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ.l08sqm
 cv808evfu8sacqj2fo3o&hs=121
LAST-MODIFIED:20141129T032343Z
LOCATION:Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western Way #104\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL 32256\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TAPROOM EVENT: Post-Prohibition Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
