UID:ljd53vrp1r6obsmpbqvbhoiiuk@google.com
CREATED:20141013T010455Z
DESCRIPTION:Veterans United Craft Brewery is honored to host Master Sergean
 t John C. Burnam (USA\, Ret.) for a special presentation and signing of his
  memoir\, “Canine Warrior: How a Vietnam Scout Dog Inspired a National Monu
 ment\,” on Saturday\, November 8\, 2014\, from 5:00pm – 7:00pm.\n\n“Canine 
 Warrior” is a riveting\, first-hand account of MSG Burnam’s combat experien
 ces as a German Shepherd Scout Dog Handler in the 44th Infantry Scout Dog P
 latoon during the Vietnam War. After his retirement from the Army\, the hig
 hly decorated veteran embarked on a quest to bring awareness to the courage
 \, loyalty\, and sacrifice of our nation’s four-footed warriors and their h
 andlers. Fueled by his love and commitment to honor these special members o
 f our armed forces\, MSG Burnam propelled a campaign which culminated in th
 e founding of the U.S. Military Working Dog Teams National Monument in San 
 Antonio\, Texas\, in 2013.\n\nMSG Burnam’s passion and dedication inspired 
 Veterans United to name one of our craft beers\, Scout Dog 44 Amber Ale\, i
 n recognition of all military working dog teams\, and is available on draft
  in the taproom and in select retail locations throughout Jacksonville.\n\n
 The presentation and book signing will be held in the new Special Events ro
 om adjacent to the taproom. Books will be available for purchase. \n\nAdmis
 sion to this event is free and open to the public.\n\nAs with all taproom e
 vents\, you are welcome to bring well-behaved and leashed dogs.\n\nPlan on 
 attending this awesome event at https://www.facebook.com/events/14794362090
 03551/ and please share with your friends!\n\nOfficial Press Release: http:
 //goo.gl/yJvc0m
LAST-MODIFIED:20141013T045807Z
LOCATION:Special Events Room\, Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western
  Way #104\, Jacksonville\, FL 32256
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TAPROOM EVENT: "Canine Warrior" Presentation & Book Signing by MSG 
 John C. Burnam
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20150404T160000Z
DTEND:20150404T230000Z
