CREATED:20141009T043217Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for this awesome evening of crafty fun! https://www.fac
 ebook.com/events/863758130300988\n\nPresented by Boykin Art-Studio and host
 ed at the taproom by yours truly\, another fabulous Drink and Draw! event i
 s slated for Saturday\, October 25th\, from 4–7pm. The beautiful model du j
 our will be April Schlegel\, who will pose for three local artists while th
 ey demonstrate their sketching and painting talents for your viewing pleasu
 re. Art supplies are provided for those who want to join the fun\, and brin
 ging your own is welcomed and encouraged.\n\nThis month's Drink and Draw! t
 heme is inspired by the U.S. Navy Blue Angels\, who will be demonstrating t
 heir sky skills at the NAS Jax Air Show 2014 on October 25th and 26th.\nThe
 re is a pretty cool prize up for grabs: Two tickets to the Navy League VIP 
 Flight Line Chalet for the second day of the air show. You'll enjoy a thril
 ling\, close-up view of all the action\, and partake in a nice barbecue lun
 ch with Veterans United beers! Simply write your name on a slip of paper an
 d add it to the bucket to participate in this cool random drawing. Free to 
 enter. Winners will be announced at 6pm and must be present to receive the 
 tickets.\n\nAdmission is just ten bucks to cover model/production fees and 
 includes one drink. Your drink ticket will be provided at the door and is g
 ood for any alcoholic or non-alcoholic drink on the menu that evening.\n\nS
 .O.S Diner will be parked outside and ready to whip up a hot\, delicious me
 al while you do all the drinking and drawing. Be sure to grab something tas
 ty to keep those creative juices flowing!\n\nGet your Drink and Draw! ticke
 ts here: http://www.eventbrite.com/e/october-drink-and-draw-tickets-1358486
 7705\n\nPlease print your ticket and bring it with you. Admission is nonref
 undable and lost drink tickets cannot be replaced.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20141011T194604Z
LOCATION:Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western Way #104\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL 32256\, United States
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:TAPROOM EVENT: Drink and Draw!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
