DESCRIPTION:Description:<b><p>(pronounced as “YOUR-mun-gand”)</p><p>Jörmung
 andrJuniper IPA was inspired by the Norse mythical creature and the popular
  Scandinavian berry.&nbsp\;&nbsp\;</p><p>The Jörmungandr was an enormous SE
 A SERPENT with venomous FANGS prowling the world’s oceans.&nbsp\;</p><p>Ins
 tead of venom\, our Jörmungandr uses juniper as its “weapon of choice\,” im
 parting PINE\, PEPPER and FRUIT flavors to this toothsome American-style IP
 A!</p><p>Watch your back while imbibing or you might have THOR\, its arch n
 emesis\, sneaking up behind you to smash your glass with his mighty war ham
 mer!</p></b>
LAST-MODIFIED:20191210T140543Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jörmungandr Juniper IPA
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
