DESCRIPTION:\n\nPARATROOPER Porter!\n\n\n\nAirborne – All The Way!   \n\n\n
 \nA PHENOM-enal dark and malty concoction with RUBY highlights topped with 
 a creamy tan head - much like a ROUND CANOPY!\n\n\n\nCHOCOLATE prevails wit
 h background notes of coffee and hints of caramel\, raisin and current!\n\n
 \n\nThe malty sweetness is very well-balanced by a moderate bitterness from
  the dark roasted grains!\n\n\n\nEnglish hops contribute a unique flavor to
  an otherwise “All American” brew!\n\n\n\n“Utrinque paratus!”  \n\n\n\n("Re
 ady For Anything!")\n\n\n\nSlàinte! 
LAST-MODIFIED:20200114T155559Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beer Release:  Paratrooper Porter
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
