 ely drinkable beer bursting with hop flavor!\n\nBrewed and dry-hopped with 
 an immense amount of Citra\, Ekuanot\, Galaxy and Mosaic hops to create the
  succulent flavor of tropical fruits and citrus!\n\nWatchStander IPA - ligh
 t golden\, hazy\, juicy\, fruity and citrusy - it's got your six!\n\nThe Fi
 re Watch\nwww.thefirewatch.org\nBecome a Watch Stander!\nStand Watch.\nSave
  Lives!
