DESCRIPTION:VU BEER o' the WEEK --->\n\n--> Mi Amigo Mexican-style Lager\n\
 nMis amigos! ❤️\n\nMi Amigo Mexican-style lager was brewed with copious amo
 unts of VIENNA malt and CORN flakes (flaked maize) giving it a BRILLIANT pa
 le color and a light\, almost AIRY mouthfeel! 🌽\n\nIt's quite REFRESHing a
 s it imparts a subtle CRISPness and a clean\, low bitterness to your PALATE
 !\n\nSo mis amigos\, ENJOY the easy-drinking Mi Amigo Mexican-style lager\,
  especially while relaxing in the Florida SUN to help BEAT the Florida HEAT
  while wiggling your TOES in the Florida SAND 🍺🦶🏖
