DESCRIPTION:It's Oktoberfest at VU! 🍺\n\nTime to haul out the LEDERHOSEN a
 nd POLKA!\n\nVU's Oktoberfest is a traditional\, festive and elegant German
 -style LAGER!🍺\n\nAKA Märzen or Märzenbier\, it's dark copper in color\, f
 ermented with German lager yeast\, exhibits flavorful notes of TOAST and BI
 SCUIT plus is subtly touched with Hallertauer hops!\n\nIt is chock full of 
 rich luscious MALT flavor and imparts a nice dry\, crisp FALL-LIKE finish! 
 🍁🍂\n\nTime for a rendition of Ein Prosit!🍺\n\nEin Prosit\, ein Prosit\nD
 er Gemütlichkeit\nEin Prosit\, ein Prosit\nDer Gemütlichkeit \nOans\, zwoa\
 , drei\, Gsuffa!\n\nZiggy Zocky Ziggy Zocky Oi Oi Oi \n\nProst!  \n\nZum wo
 hl!  \n\nGenieße das Leben ständig! \n\n("Cheers!  \n\nTo your health!  \n\
 nAlways enjoy life!") \n\nProst! 🍺\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
LAST-MODIFIED:20210913T163228Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:VU 🍺 Release --> Oktoberfest 
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
