DESCRIPTION:VU🍺 o' the WEEK --->\n\nWilson's Last Pour - A Pre-Prohibition
  Lager🍺\n\nIn 1919\, the US House and Senate overrode President Wilson's V
 ETO of the Volstead Act.\n\nIt bolstered the Eighteenth Amendment and made 
 it illegal to “manufacture\, sell\, barter\, transport\, import\, export\, 
 deliver\, furnish\, or possess” intoxicating beverages.\n\nHence\, it's Wil
 son's Last Pour!🍺\n\nIt's a smooth\, crisp\, refreshing\, bright and clean
 -tasting lager!\n\nAvailable in the taproom on Tuesday!\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
LAST-MODIFIED:20230116T182328Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Wilson's Last Pour Pre-Prohibition Lager
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
