DESCRIPTION:Veterans United Craft Brewery has teamed up with Mother Truckin
 ' Pizza to offer a really cool pairing of our delicious beers and their fre
 akin' fantastic pizza!\n\n🍕🍺💗\n\nEach pairing consists of FOUR (4 fl oz)
  VU beers and FOUR slices of Mother Truckin' Pizza.\n\n\nThe pairings inclu
 de:\n\nBuzzin' Bee Honey Rye Wheat - Hawaiian Pizza\n\nThe Kraken Hazy Juic
 y IPA - Meat Lovers Pizza\n\nHopBanshee IPA - Mexican-style Pizza\n\nScout 
 Dog 44 Altbier - Cream Cheese Jalapeño Pineapple Bacon Pizza\n\nTickets are
  $28 per person.\n\nCurrent VU MUG CLUB MEMBERS will receive an ADDITIONAL 
 4-oz POUR of their choice VU beer.\n\nTickets are available for purchase vi
 a Eventbrite\, in our taproom\, or by calling our brewery at (904) 253-3326
 . \n\nPrice does not include tax.\n\nhttps://www.eventbrite.com/e/craft-bee
 r-pizza-pairing-tickets-153830460047?aff=ebdssbdestsearch\n\nShow up anytim
 e between 6:30 pm - 9:30 pm to be served your pairing.\n\nStick around for 
 our FREE monthly COMEDY SHOW which begins at 8 pm that evening!\n\nSlàinte!
  🍻
LAST-MODIFIED:20210608T154323Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beer & Pizza Pairing with Mother Truckin' Pizza 🍕🍺❤️
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
