 h copious amounts of VIENNA malt and CORN flakes (flaked maize) giving it a
  BRILLIANT pale color and a light\, almost AIRY mouthfeel! 🌽\n\n\nIt's qui
 te REFRESHing as it imparts a subtle CRISPness and a CLEAN\, low bitterness
  to your PALATE!\n\n\nSo mis amigos\, ENJOY the easy-drinking Mi Amigo Mexi
 can-style lager\, especially while relaxing in the Florida SUN to help BEAT
  the Florida HEAT while wiggling your TOES in the Florida SAND! 🍺🦶🏝 
