X-GOOGLE-CONFERENCE:https://meet.google.com/xza-nenn-uhs
CREATED:20210927T143019Z
DESCRIPTION:Join Vets on T.A.P. for live networking at Veterans United Craf
 t Brewery on Tuesday 9/28 from 6-9PM.\n\nBring a friend!\n\nVets on TAP is 
 a group for transitioning military\, veterans\, spouses\, local veterans\, 
 non-profit organizations and business leaders in Jacksonville\, FL.\n\nAfte
 r your dedicated service to our country or as a dependent\, you need a resu
 me that reflects your abilities and achievements as a Veteran (or dependent
 ) in way that also makes you stand out as a civilian.\n\nAll are proud of y
 our military service\, but military jargon and acronyms don't translate so 
 well to the civilian sector.\n\n"I want to work in project management for a
  software company but I need help explaining my MARSOC EOD background."\n\n
 Vets on TAP provides a low-pressure environment for its members to discuss 
 employment\, education and training opportunities over a local craft beer.\
 n\nThe mission and goal is to help members obtain employment\, so please sh
 are your successes!\n\nVets on TAP can only grow with the continued support
  of its members.\n\nPlease help us in publicizing events (share FB postings
 !) and invite friends along!\n\nJoin us over a pint of great craft beer\, e
 njoy shared experiences\, discuss similar issues with employment search\, m
 ake new friends and learn about getting your resume fine-tuned and MORE! 🍻
 \n\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/xza-nenn-uhs\n\nLearn mo
 re about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20210927T143019Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Event Room: Vets On Tap - Networking Event
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
