DESCRIPTION:CosmicKat is a Belgian-style Golden Strong Ale made with four d
 ifferent malts\, two types of sugar and special Belgian yeast known to prod
 uce highly complex and flavorful ales.\n\nAmber gold in color with a nice w
 hite head\, the gentle malt flavor blends well with notes of pepper and spi
 ce. \n\nWhile fairly dry\, the higher alcohol level adds some warmth and a 
 touch of sweetness to round out the smooth finish.
