DESCRIPTION:\nVU&#39\;s Oktoberfest won the silver medal in the German-Styl
 e Märzen category in the Best Florida Beer Oktoberfest Competition 2021! ❤️
 \n\nCome get a pint 🍺 of VU&#39\;s award-winning BIER on Tuesday August 23
 rd!\n\nTime to haul out the LEDERHOSEN and POLKA!\n\nVU&#39\;s Oktoberfest 
 is a traditional\, festive and elegant German-style LAGER!🍺\n\nAKA Märzen 
 or Märzenbier\, it&#39\;s dark copper in color\, fermented with German lage
 r yeast\, exhibits flavorful notes of TOAST and BISCUIT plus is subtly touc
 hed with Hallertauer hops!\n\nIt is chock full of rich luscious MALT flavor
  and imparts a nice dry\, crisp FALL-LIKE finish! 🍁🍂
