DESCRIPTION:Airborne – All The Way!🪂🍺\n\nReporting for duty in the VU Tap
 room!\n\nA PHENOMENAL dark and malty concoction with RUBY highlights topped
  with a creamy tan head - much like a ROUND CANOPY!🪂\n\nCHOCOLATE prevails
  with background notes of coffee and hints of caramel\, raisin and current!
  🍫☕\n\nThe malty sweetness is very well-balanced by a moderate bitterness 
 from the dark roasted grains!\n\nEnglish hops contribute a unique flavor to
  an otherwise “All American” brew!\n\n“Utrinque paratus!”🪂🍺\n\n("Ready Fo
 r Anything!")\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
LAST-MODIFIED:20211018T170407Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Paratrooper Porter🪂🍺
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
