DESCRIPTION:Morrigan Irish Dry Stout is a dark\, roasty beer that is light-
 bodied but full of chocolate and coffee flavors!\n\n\nBrewed with a mixture
  of Maris Otter and pale malt for its base\, we layered on some roasted and
  flaked barley for additional flavor and depth.  \n\n\nThis beer will not w
 eigh you down and is extremely sessionable with an ABV of 3.6%!\n\n\nMorrig
 an\, Celtic warrior-queen goddess\, incites conflict as well as fury and fr
 enzy\, as in which VU BREW to choose first?\n\n\nMorrigan can predict the f
 uture\, cast spells and she can change her form\, meaning you WILL be ENJOY
 ING an IRISH DRY STOUT!\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
LAST-MODIFIED:20210301T181415Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Morrigan Irish Dry Stout
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
