DESCRIPTION:VU🍺 o&#39\; the WEEK ---&gt\;\n\nOh my paws! 🐾\n\nIt&#39\;s T
 he Lassie!\n\nIs Timmy in the well again?🙀\n\nNot this time!😺\n\nIt&#39\;
 s VU&#39\;s Lassie\, a Blueberry Orange Honey Amber!\n\nTotally PAWESOME - 
 it has the BLUEBERRY &quot\;pop\,&quot\; the zesty citrus juicy goodness of
  ORANGE and the warmth of HONEY and malt!\n\nIt&#39\;s Oh là là PAW-amazing
 !\n🍊🍯🐕🐾❤️🍺\n\nFYI Lassie (the original TV series) - played by rough co
 llies\n\nPal\, the first ever dog to play the legendary dog Lassie in Lassi
 e Come Home (1943)\, appeared in the pilot of this TV series.\n\nAll the La
 ssies were played by male dogs.\n\nThe collie that played Lassie the longes
 t was named Baby. Baby was the grandson of Pal\, the original Lassie.\n\nTh
 e Lassie dogs during the TV series:\n\n*Pal (Pilot episodes)\n*Lassie Junio
 r (1954–1959)\n*Spook (1960)\n*Baby (1960–1966)\n*Mire (1966–1971)\n*Hey He
 y (1971–1973)\n\nWOOF!\n🐕🐾❤️\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
LAST-MODIFIED:20220912T174151Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The Lassie - Blueberry Orange Honey Amber🍺
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
