DESCRIPTION:Brian McCluney Memorial Blood Drive\n\nCelebrate the life of a 
 special member of our community\, Brian McCluney. 💗\n\nBrian was a Jackson
 ville firefighter who went missing at sea in August 2019. \n\nWe invite you
  to help honor his legacy and service by donating life-saving blood!\n\nCom
 e join the Big Red Bus!\n\nAll donors will receive a FREE OneBlood Gift and
  $10 eGift Card (from OneBlood).\n\nThe bus will be given an email sign up 
 sheet for all donors to receive a VU coupon (good on your next visit to the
  taproom) and to receive VU newsletters!\n\nJoin with Google Meet: https://
 meet.google.com/cfq-xnkg-zhn\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.g
 oogle.com/a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20210511T204115Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Brian McCluney Memorial Blood Drive - Blood Bus Onsite
TRANSP:OPAQUE
