DESCRIPTION:Our CUP o' JOE OATMEAL ESPRESSO STOUT is an easy-drinking\, DAR
 K\, medium-bodied OATMEAL STOUT infused with ROASTED COFFEE!\n\n\n\nThe COF
 FEE is from our friends over at @socialgroundscoffeecompany!\n\nIt is BREWE
 D (pun intended!) with 8 different types of GRAIN and balanced with a healt
 hy dose of HOPS!\n\nNotes of MALTED MILK\, CHOCOLATE and ESPRESSO abound!\n
 \n\nCup O’ Joe has a RICH\, complex flavor that finishes with a nice SILKY 
 FINISH - even MORE SO now that it's on NITRO for YOU!\n\n\nIt's cascading S
 UCCULENT voluptuous DELICIOUSNESS all WRAPPED and DRAPED in VELVETY lusciou
 sness!    \n\nA pint o' HEAVEN in your mouth and tummy!
