DESCRIPTION:Mystery MUG CLUB Weekly Winner and Happy Hour!\n\nFor MUG CLUB 
 members only!\n\nEvery Tuesday we'll draw from our MUG CLUB member numbers 
 and a WEEKLY MUG CLUB member will be randomly selected to WIN one FREE VU B
 REW mug-fill!\n\n🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺🍺\n\nTo find out 
 if YOU are the MYSTERY MUG CLUB winner for the week\, come to the brewery d
 uring the winning week from Tuesday - Sunday to find out if it is YOU and g
 et your FREE VU BREW mug-fill!\n\nSorry - winners are not contacted\, you n
 eed to come to the brewery to win during that week\, winners are only winne
 rs for that one week and there are no rain checks!\n\nALL MUG CLUB members 
 are eligible every week to win for the week - so YOU can win multiple times
 !\n\nFor the other MUG CLUBBERs\, no worries!\n\nThere's MUG CLUB Happy Hou
 r on Tuesdays (all day) and also Wednesdays - Fridays 4PM - 6PM!\n\nIt's $1
  OFF all MUG DRAFTs for you during Happy Hour!\n\nSlàinte! 🍻🍻🍻
