DESCRIPTION:VU BEER o' the WEEK --->\n\nThe HEDGIE returns!\n\nIt's our Hed
 gehog Hefeweizen!\n🦔🍺❤️\n\nHedgehog Hefeweizen is a Bavarian-style wheat 
 ale made with over 50% wheat malt\, German hops & fermented with Hefeweizen
  yeast! \n\nIt has a gorgeous straw color\, thick head plus flavor and arom
 a of spicy clove with hints of banana bread - YUM!\n\nEnchantingly delightf
 ul and great for celebrating summer!  
