DESCRIPTION:Naughty Rye is a thirst-quenching pale ale that pours with a be
 autiful white head and is light golden in color. \n\nGreeting you with a ci
 trusy aroma of grapefruit with hints of melon\, she entices you to further 
 explore and enjoy the full flavor imparted by the bountiful use of rye malt
  and citra hops. \n\nWhile predominantly hoppy upfront\, her flavor quickly
  transcends to a spicy and crisp finish provoking another savory sip.
