DESCRIPTION:LOOK!\n\nUp in the sky!\n\nIt's a BIRD!\n\nIt's a PLANE!\n\nNo 
 - it's VU'S Flying Squirrel Nut Brown Ale! 🐿🍺\n\nVU Brew's FLYING SQUIRRE
 L NUT BROWN ALE is making a landing TUESDAY for the season after dropping i
 t's load of acorns!\n\nFlying Squirrel is an American version of the Northe
 rn English Brown Ale style.\n\nHighly drinkable and very enjoyable\, this S
 UMPTUOUS ale LAVISHES you with its moderate malt sweetness\, NUTTY CARAMEL 
 character and subtle hints of TOFFEE! 🐿🍺\n\nBOLO while imbibing - you mig
 ht have a furry rodent friend dropping its FLAVOR payload on you from above
 !\n\nAvailable in the taproom on Tuesday!\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
LAST-MODIFIED:20210920T172846Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Flying Squirrel Nut Brown Ale🐿🍺
