DESCRIPTION:<html-blob>Meet &amp\; Greet &amp\; Book signing<br><br><br>My 
 book\, Blue Sky Gone\, is a historical fiction novel about 9/11\, and since
  its publication ahead of the 20th anniversary\, it has been on Amazon's to
 p 100 bestsellers lists.&nbsp\;</html-blob><br><html-blob><br></html-blob><
 br><html-blob>It brings to light many issues\, such as the loss and sacrifi
 ce of our first responders\, as well as the progressive illnesses being suf
 fered to this day.&nbsp\;</html-blob><br><html-blob><br></html-blob><br><ht
 ml-blob>I donate a portion of the sales to the Tunnels to Towers Foundation
 \, as well as the 9/11 Memorial. <u></u><u></u></html-blob>\n\nJoin with Go
 ogle Meet: https://meet.google.com/wym-wath-xsa\nOr dial: (US) +1 954-998-5
 256 PIN: 131178563#\nMore phone numbers: https://tel.meet/wym-wath-xsa?pin=
 6925112157400&hs=7\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.com/
 a/users/answer/9282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20220404T180829Z
