DESCRIPTION: Professor MEOWington English IPA\n\n\n🐈🐾🍺\n\n\nProfessor Me
 owington is a cunning and conniving loyalist from across the pond\; he is t
 he arch adversary to our favorite colonial\, Lord FurryBottom!\n\n\n🐕🐾🍺\
 n\n\nThe Professor combines a unique blend of Anglo-American brewing ingred
 ients in a distinctive concoction.    \n\n\nWhen a traditionally hopped Ame
 rican India Pale Ale is fermented with an English yeast\, the resulting bee
 r will SURPRISE and DELIGHT you!    \n\n\nThis IPA is the CAT'S MEOW! \n\n\
 n🐈🐾🍺\n\n\nAvailable in the taproom on Tuesday!\n\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
