DESCRIPTION:<u></u><p><span>VU🍺</span><span> </span><span>o&#39\; the WEEK
  ---&gt\;</span><br></p><p> <br>Alert 5 IPA🍺<br><br><br>Farah &amp\; Farah
  partnered with Veterans United Craft Brewery to offer a unique craft beer 
 in support of 5 Star Veterans Center!<br><br><br>For every Alert 5 IPA🍺 po
 ur\, Farah &amp\; Farah is donating $5 to 5 Star Veterans Center!❤️<br><br>
 <br>Alert 5 IPA is a Bavarian-style IPA (BIPA) brewed with all German malt 
 and hops.  <br><br><br>Late hop additions in the whirlpool and then in the 
 fermentation vessel give this beer intense hop aromas reminiscent of citrus
 \, melons and other tropical fruits.  <br><br><br>While being hop-focused\,
  bitterness is restrained and blends well with the malty sweetness and cara
 mel notes imparted by the grain.  <br><br><br>Well-balanced and highly drin
 kable\,<br>Alert 5 IPA will have you at the ready for a refill🍺!<br><br><b
 r>Malts: Vienna\, Pils\, Red X\, and Caramel Hell                    <br><b
 r><br>***&quot\;hell&quot\; translates to &quot\;bright or light&quot\; in 
 German***<br><br><br>Hops: Hallertau Magnum\, Hallertau Blanc\, Huell Melon
 \, and Mandarina Bavaria<br><br><br>ABV: 6.4%<br><br><br>Available in the t
 aproom on Tuesday!<br></p><u></u>
LAST-MODIFIED:20221031T161519Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Alert 5 IPA🍺
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
