 d 1: 7-8pm<br>Round 2: 8-9pm<br><br><br>Gift certificates for each 1hr bloc
 k\, <b>CANNOT</b> be used on the same night they were awarded.<br><br><br><
 b><u>Tournament Gift Certificates - only two prizes awarded per game regard
 less of the number of players</u></b><ul><li>For any <b>particular</b> game
 :<ul><li><b>First Place:</b> $15 gift certificate</li><li><b>Second Place:<
 /b> $10 gift certificate</li></ul></li></ul><u><b>Check to Trivia Night Liv
 e</b></u><br>Check Amount based on <u>Average Players for Two Games</u>:<br
 ><ul><li>0 - 14 players = $50 <br></li><li>15 - 19 players = $75 <br></li><
