DESCRIPTION:\nVU🍺 o' the WEEK --->\n\nCup O' Joe Oatmeal Espresso Stout☕🍺
 \n\nCup O' Joe is an easy-drinking\, dark\, medium-bodied OATMEAL STOUT inf
 used with roasted COFFEE during\nthe conditioning stage.\n\nThe coffee is f
 rom our friends over at Social Grounds Coffee Roasters☕❤️ - Oorah - Semper 
 Fi!\n\nCup O' Joe is also BREWED (pun intended!) with 8 different types of 
 GRAIN and balanced with a healthy dose of HOPS.\n\nCup O’ Joe has a RICH\, 
 complex flavor that ends with a nice SILKY FINISH!\n\nYum!😺\n\nAvailable i
 n the taproom on Tuesday on draft and COMING SOON in limited-release 6-pack
 s!\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
