DESCRIPTION:Can you say Sven / Svend / Svein / Sveinn?\n\n\nThen you too ca
 n say “YOUR-mun-gand!”\n\n\n\nJörmungandr Juniper IPA is inspired by Norse 
 legend and the popular Scandinavian berry.  \n\n\nThe Jörmungandr is an eno
 rmous SEA SERPENT with venomous FANGS prowling the world’s oceans. \n\n🐲🐉
 \n\n\n\n️Instead of venom\, our Jörmungandr uses JUNIPER as its “weapon of 
 choice\,” imparting PINE\, PEPPER and FRUIT notes to this toothsome America
 n-style IPA!\n\n\n\nWatch your back while imbibing or you might have THOR\,
  its arch nemesis\, sneaking up behind you to smash your glass with his mig
 hty WAR HAMMER! 🙀\n \n\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
LAST-MODIFIED:20210322T024200Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jörmungandr Juniper IPA - Beer Release
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
