UID:63k0k1i9b5kf78k0k185lcjheo@google.com
CREATED:20201117T065817Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Beer o&#39\; the Week ---&gt\; MAN in the MOON S&#39\;aison<
 /p><p><br></p><p>Gotta a GOESTING for a S&#39\;aison?<br></p><p><br></p><p>
 MAN in the MOON is a twist on the Belgian-style S&#39\;aison through its us
 e of late addition CITRUS-oriented HOPS! </p><p><br></p><p>AMARILLO and CIT
 RUS hops mix it up with sweet and sour ORANGE peel and BELGIAN yeast\, givi
 ng this ALE light-bodied FRUITY and SPICY notes with an EXTREMEly refreshin
 g DRY finish!<br></p><br><p> </p><p>Traditionally brewed as a fortifying dr
 ink for farmhands during the harvest season\, S&#39\;AISONS needed to nouri
 sh and refresh but NOT intoxicate so that work could continue in the fields
  after imbibing this wonderful ELIXIR!<br></p><p><br></p><p>MAN in the MOON
  is a “table beer” that PAIRS well with most foods and is immensely QUAFFAB
 LE! </p><p><br></p><p>Slàinte! 🍻<br></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20201117T065817Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Beer Release: Man in the Moon S'aison
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
