CREATED:20200108T231203Z
DESCRIPTION:<p><a href="https://www.facebook.com/puzzledpintjax/">Puzzled P
 int Jacksonville</a> is a casual event for puzzle lovers occurring on the s
 econd Tuesday of each month.<br><br>The weekend before each event we post a
  location puzzle to our official web site!</p><p><a href="http://www.puzzle
 dpint.com/">http://www.puzzledpint.com/</a>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;<br></p><p><br>The
  solution will lead you to a local taproom in your city!<br><br>On the nigh
 t of the event\, we'll be at the taproom with more puzzles for you to solve
  while you enjoy drinks and food!</p><p>Just show up at the bar and look fo
 r the Puzzled Pint logo!<br></p><p><br>If you don't have a team\, we can in
 troduce you to other puzzlers who want to join forces!<br><br>And hints are
  always free!<br><br>Standings will be posted every month but the goal of <
 a href="https://www.facebook.com/PuzzledPint/">Puzzled Pint</a> is for ever
 yone to LOTS of FUN!<br><br>We welcome your thoughts on how to improve futu
 re events!<br><br>See you in the taproom!<br><br>NEKO ATSUME - theme hint!!
 !  </p><p>Don't forget to bring pens\, pencils\, scissors\, and tape!</p><p
 >No pre-registration is necessary!&nbsp\;</p><p></p><p><br>*FYI - Feel free
  to bring your own grub\, have some delivered\, get some take away or nosh 
 on something at the taproom by @<a href="https://www.facebook.com/BrewBoxFo
