DESCRIPTION:BEER o' the Week --->\n\nEschenfrau Helles \n\n🌳🌞🍺\n\nEshenf
 rau is The Guardian of The Ash Tree\, who is quite a malicious and vengeful
  being\, capable of much malice and damage - break one of her branches or t
 wigs and she will descend upon you and wreak havoc!\n\nPropitiate her by en
 joying our Eschenfrau German-style HELLES\, a full-bodied\, mildly sweet\, 
 BRIGHT and LIGHT-colored lager\, with low bitterness!\n\n(hell means bright
 \, light and/or pale in German)
