DESCRIPTION:St Arnoldus\, a monk and brewer\, urged his congregation to “Dr
 ink Beer\, Not Water” during a plague epidemic. Because beer is sterilized 
 in production (water is boiled during the mashing in process) and the local
  water was the source of the sickness\, people were saved. A true miracle! 
  Oudenburg\, Belgium\n\nSt Arnoldus circa 1040-1087
LAST-MODIFIED:20200718T144530Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:St Arnoldus Day - Belgium
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
