UID:7kor5c62kkbtojb7mu5h1k9krc@google.com
CREATED:20220912T174420Z
DESCRIPTION:\nVU's POW/MIA IPA is a collaboration between Veterans United C
 raft Brewery and the Cecil Field POW MIA Memorial\, Inc.🍺❤️\n\nVU's POW/MI
 A IPA is a hazy\, juicy New England-style IPA brewed and fermented with cop
 ious amounts of hops.\n\nMandarina Bavaria\, Idaho 7\, El Dorado and Galaxy
  hops are used in the double dry hop to give this beer immense citrus and t
 ropical fruit aromas and flavors!\n\nRefreshingly bright in flavor but low 
 in bitterness\, VU's POW/MIA IPA is light golden in color and pours with a 
 beautiful white head.\n\nRelease Date in the VU Taproom is on National POW/
 MIA Recognition Day 2022 - Friday September 16.\n\nThe National POW/MIA Mem
 orial & Museum is located in Jacksonville\, FL at former NAS Cecil Field.\n
 \nThe 26-acre project is currently under construction.\n\n*Remember\n\n*Hon
 or\n\n*Educate
LAST-MODIFIED:20220912T174531Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:POW*MIA IPA ---> VU🍺Release
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
