DESCRIPTION:Veterans United has selected four of our beers to pair up with 
 professionally made cookie<br>dough. The pairings are designed to highlight
  the flavor combinations of each item and how they<br>interact with each ot
 her.<br><br>Participants will receive four 4-ounce pours of preselected VU 
 beers. <br><br>These beers will be paired with four 1-ounce cookie dough sa
 mples. <br><br>Participants will check in at the bar upon arrival and will 
 be given a box of cookie dough\, a flight of beers and guided instruction s
 heet.<br><br><ul><li>Early Ticket Sales - $15 + TAX</li><li>Same-Day Sale -
  $18 + TAX</li><li>Mug Club Member Ticket - $15 + TAX</li></ul>
LAST-MODIFIED:20210816T141926Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:VU 🍺 & Cookie Dough Pairing 🍪
TRANSP:OPAQUE
