DESCRIPTION:VU 🍺 o&#39\; the WEEK ---&gt\;\n\n\nOh my paws! 🐾\n\n\nIt&#39
 \;s Rin Tin Tin Honey Amber Ale!\n\n\nTotally pawesome - the warmth of hone
 y and malt - Oh là là PAW-amazing!\n🍯🐕🐾❤️🍺\n\n\nFYI Rin Tin Tin (the or
 iginal) \n\n\nRin Tin Tin was born in Flirey\, France in September 1918 and
  was rescued from a World War I battlefield by an American soldier\, Lee Du
 ncan\, who nicknamed him &quot\;Rinty&quot\;.\n\n\nThe original Rin Tin Tin
  (&quot\;Rinty&quot\;) passed August 10\, 1932.\n\n\nRin Tin Tin is immorta
 lized in comics\, movies and TV.\n\n\nWOOF!\n🐕🐾❤️\n\n\nSlàinte! 🍻\n\n\nA
 vailable in the taproom on Tuesday!
