DESCRIPTION:Bruin Monk Belgian-style Dubbel ! 🐻🍺\n\nBruin Monk Belgian-st
 yle Dubbel pours sienna in color swirling with dark reddish hues that emit 
 aromas of dark fruit and a hint of banana!  \n\nBruin Monk is a well-balanc
 ed malt-forward beer with luxurious flavors of currant\, raisin\, dark cher
 ries and caramel. \n\nServed in a snifter to enhance its complex aromas\, t
 his 7.1% ale is enjoyed slowly while savoring its rich luscious flavors!\n\
 nIt's Heavenly! ☁️🕊🎼
