DESCRIPTION:\nShe's BACK! \n\nIs it déjà vu?\n\nNo - it's VU's AVENGING ANG
 EL! \n\nAvenging Angel is a SERIOUS pale ale PACKED with HOP flavor and a P
 LEASING amount of bitterness!\n\nAmarillo\, Simcoe and Cascade HOPS provide
  a HEAVENLY aroma of citrus and mango which MELDS well with its malt flavor
 s!\n\nAvenging Angel is dry and crisp allowing her HOPS to be showcased in 
 ALL their full glory!\n\nTake a break from all the IPAs and rediscover this
  classic\, highly drinkable and immensely ENJOYABLE style!\n\nSlàinte! 
