DESCRIPTION:\nIt's National Beer Day!\n\n\nBe sure to raise a glass for the
  VIRTUAL TOAST!\n\n\nNational Beer Day History\n\n\nOn April 7\, 1933\, the
  law that President FDR signed allowing folks to brew and sell beer in the 
 US was enacted\, which was the first step to reversing Prohibition! \n\n\nA
 fter signing the legislation\, FDR famously stated\, “I think this would be
  a good time for a beer.”\n\n\nBeer drinkers celebrated and were happy to b
 e able to purchase beer again for the first time in THIRTEEN years!\n\n\nSl
 àinte!
LAST-MODIFIED:20200406T191137Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:National Beer Day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
