 d out if it is YOU and get your FREE VU BREW mug-fill!\n\nSorry - winners a
 re not contacted\, you need to come to the brewery to win during that week\
 , winners are only winners for that one week and there are no rain checks!\
 n\nALL MUG CLUB members are eligible every week to win for the week - so YO
 U can win multiple times!\n\nFor the other MUG CLUBBERs\, no worries!\n\nTh
 ere's MUG CLUB Happy Hour on Tuesdays (all day) and also Wednesdays - Frida
 ys 3PM - 6PM!\n\nIt's 15% OFF all MUG DRAFTs for you during Happy Hour!\n\n
