DESCRIPTION:Comedy Night with Comedy On Tap!\n\n\nDINNER too - To Be Frank 
 is here at 5:30PM!🌭\n\n\nAnd it's VU's 7th Anniversary Birthday Party! 🎂\
 n\n\nWhat better way to spend your SATURDAY night on August 21st then at VU
  BREW enjoying VU Brew craft 🍺\, eating awesome food and howling and roari
 ng with laughter until comes out your nose?! 🍺\n\n\nThere's live stand-up 
 comedy\, VU 🍺\, cider and wine (plus soda and water for the DD unless you 
 use Uber)!\n\n\nThis is an entirely FREE comedy show that features talented
  comedians with each doing a set.\n\n\nOur taproom packs out to max capacit
 y and it'll be standing room only\, so be sure to get here early quick like
  a BUNNY and grab a seat! 🐇🐰\n\n\nKids are welcome but be warned that som
 e content may not be suitable for children.\n\n\nSpecifically\, don't be to
 o upset with us or the comedians if your child opts to repeat something dee
 med inappropriate to someone\, such as your in-laws or their teachers! 🙀\n
 \n\nThe show starts at 8PM!\n\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
LAST-MODIFIED:20240709T164843Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Taproom: COMEDY SHOW
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
