 uring the winning week from Tuesday - Sunday to find out if it is YOU and g
 et your FREE VU BREW mug-fill!\n\nSorry - winners are not contacted\, you n
 eed to come to the brewery to win during that week\, winners are only winne
 rs for that one week and there are no rain checks!\n\nALL MUG CLUB members 
