DESCRIPTION:<br>Robert Half is excited to partner with Dreams Come True for
  our 6th Annual Tech on Tap Toy Drive event!<br><br>💻🍺🧸<br><br>Please br
 ing a toy (valued at $10 or more) and you will receive an extra drink ticke
 t!<br><br>All toys are for local children between the ages of 2-18.<br><br>
 Join us and help bring brighter holidays to the children of Jacksonville!<b
 r><br>Some toy suggestions:<br><br>Teen items are always a big need! Art su
 pplies and sets\, wireless speakers\, digital camera sets\, twin/full beddi
 ng\, weighted blankets\, wireless bluetooth earbuds\, wired headphones\, ga
 ming headsets\, gaming chairs\, bikes\, toy drones\, makeup sets\, nerf set
 s\, tumblers\, etc.<br><br>Sensory toys: LeapFrog interactive toys\, water 
 and sand sensory table\, sensory cube\, wall mats and toys\, play/magnetic 
 sand\, sensory fidget tubes\, fidget toys\, etc<br><br>Popular Children Toy
 s: Superhero toys\, Princess toys\, Melissa and Doug toys\, learning tablet
 s\, Artist EZ easel\, Little Tikes sets\, 3-in-1 Baby activity push walker\
 , magnetic tiles\, Play-Doh\, Bluey\, Kids playmats\, Peppa Pig\, Paw Patro
 l\, Slime kits\, etc<br><br>Dreams Come True<br><br>Dreams Come True is a n
 on-profit organization dedicated to granting the dreams of children with li
 fe threatening illnesses.<br><br>As the First Coast’s only locally-based or
 ganization dedicated to making dreams come true\, we are proud to say that 
 we have never turned away a dreamer and we never will.<br><br>We can do thi
 s because of the generosity of our donors\, business partners\, program spo
 nsors\, and the support of our Board of Directors.<br><br>We are not affili
 ated with any national wish-granting charity and 100% of all donations go t
 oward fulfilling dreams\, unless otherwise directed by the donor.<br><br>Mo
 re than 30 years later\, Dreams Come True has fulfilled the dreams of more 
 than 4\,000 children in North Florida and South Georgia!<br><br>No cost to 
 attend --&gt\; see Meet Up link<br><br><a href="https://www.meetup.com/tech
 ontapjax/events/304399795/">https://www.meetup.com/techontapjax/events/3043
 99795/</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20241210T184514Z
LOCATION:Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western Way #104\, Jacksonvil
 le\, FL 32256\, USA
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tech on Tap Toy Drive💻🍺🧸
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
