DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://marineraiderfoundation.org/master-sergeant-aar
 on-c-torian/">https://marineraiderfoundation.org/master-sergeant-aaron-c-to
 rian/</a><br><br>Raise a pint to <b>Marine Master Sergeant Aaron Torian</b>
  today on his birthday<br><br>A highly-decorated Marine and war hero\, Mast
 er Sgt. Torian\, 36\, died February 15\, 2014 from injuries sustained durin
 g combat training operations while serving in Helmand Province\, Afghanista
 n.<br><br>Having served two prior tours in Iraq and three in Afghanistan du
 ring Operation Enduring Freedom\, Aaron deployed in October 2013 for his si
 xth tour. <br><br>Aaron's awards include the Purple Heart\, Navy Commendati
 on Medal with Combat Distinguishing Device\, Navy and Marine Corps Achievem
 ent Medal\, Combat Action Ribbon with gold star\, Sea Service Deployment Ri
 bbon with three stars\, Global War on Terrorism Expeditionary Medal\, Globa
 l War on Terrorism Service Medal\, Iraq Campaign Medal\, Afghanistan Campai
 gn and the Good Conduct Medal.<br><br>Aaron was respected and loved by ever
 yone he met and with whom he worked\; he was a loving and dedicated father\
 , husband\, son\, brother and friend. <br><br>May Aaron's cherished memory 
 be eternal.<br><br>Until Valhalla🍺
LAST-MODIFIED:20260319T170328Z
LOCATION:Veterans United Craft Brewery\, 8999 Western Way\, Jacksonville\, 
 FL 32256\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Salute to Marine Master Sergeant Aaron Torian
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
