DESCRIPTION:<b>This will not conflict with poker.</b><br><br><p>The Muster 
 is a relaxed\, veteran-centered social gathering held at restaurants\, brew
 eries\, pubs\, coffee shops\, and other community-minded local businesses.<
 /p><p>Our goal is to build long-term partnerships with venues that want to 
 support veterans while also bringing people into their space. These events 
 are designed to serve veterans and the broader community by giving people a
  place to reconnect\, meet others\, and build lasting camaraderie beyond th
 e uniform.</p>\n\nJoin with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/vyb-jret-j
 ug\n\nLearn more about Meet at: https://support.google.com/a/users/answer/9
 282720
LAST-MODIFIED:20260728T181018Z
