DESCRIPTION:FREE VU🍺 Brewery Tour by one of VU🍺's Brewers❤️\n\n\n\nVetera
 ns United Craft Brewery🍺 FREE TOUR Saturdays at 2PM!\n\n\nYOU and your fri
 ends don't know what to do?\n\n\nBring your CREW to VU🍺 for a behind-the-s
 cenes BREWERY TOUR and MORE!\n\n\nMeet one of VU🍺's Brewers!❤️\n\n\nLearn 
 how we came to be Veterans United Craft Brewery🍺!\n\n\nWant to better unde
 rstand how VU🍺 is brewed on VU🍺's system?\n\n\nNeed a review of the basic
 s of BREWING - water\, yeast\, grains and hops!\n\n\nWhat's the difference 
 between an ALE and a LAGER?\n\n\nBrewers call water WHAT?\n\n\nWant to chec
 k out our brewhouse\, cellar and packaging lines?\n\n\nHow much volume is a
  BBL A KEG? A 1/2 BBL KEG? A SIXTEL?\n\n\nSee where we CAN the VU🍺 CORE!\n
 \n*Raging Blonde\n*HopBanshee IPA\n*Scout Dog 44\n*Buzzin' Bee\n*Fish Camp 
 Pils\n*Wacky Badger\n\nand MORE!\n\n\nVU🍺is freshest at the SOURCE - we BR
 EW and CAN on premises!\n\n\nTOURS are FREE!\n\n- GET 10% off a flight / be
 er paddle AFTER the tour\n- There are FOUR 4-ounce pours in a flight\n\n\n*
 **discount only valid if you actually go on the tour!***\n\n\nTours every S
 aturday at 2PM!\n\n\nFYI - you can purchase 6-PACKS\, CROWLERS and GROWLER 
 fills directly from VU🍺!\n\n\nAsk your bartender for details!\n\n\nSlàinte
 !🍻
LAST-MODIFIED:20260104T132310Z
