DESCRIPTION:VU🍺 o&#39\; the WEEK ---&gt\;\n\nWilson&#39\;s Last Pour - A P
 re-Prohibition Lager🍺\n\nIn 1919\, the US House and Senate overrode Presid
 ent Wilson&#39\;s VETO of the Volstead Act.\n\nIt bolstered the Eighteenth 
 Amendment and made it illegal to “manufacture\, sell\, barter\, transport\,
  import\, export\, deliver\, furnish\, or possess” intoxicating beverages.\
 n\nHence\, it&#39\;s Wilson&#39\;s Last Pour!🍺\n\nIt&#39\;s a smooth\, cri
 sp\, refreshing\, bright and clean-tasting lager!\n\nAvailable in the tapro
 om on Tuesday!\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
LAST-MODIFIED:20251125T214154Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Wilson's Last Pour Pre-Prohibition LITE💡🍺 Lager ABV 3.6%
