UID:48jg23avmbm48fnhajt290gc5d@google.com
CREATED:20251028T163047Z
DESCRIPTION:<b>VU Raffle basket - thru the month of oct and nov until the b
 ingo</b><br><b><br></b><br><b>$10 to play Bingo<br>$5 for Raffle Ticket<br>
 </b><br><br><b>BDAF</b><br><b><br></b><br><b>The Brooke Davis Angel Fund\, 
 in honor of Dr. Brooke Davis\, is a 501(c)(3) non-profit providing financia
 l assistance for veterinary care to animals in need. Our mission is to supp
 ort pets whose owners face financial hardship\, ensuring they receive the m
 edical care necessary for recovery and well-being. </b><br><p><strong><b>Br
 ooke graduated from the University of North Florida in Jacksonville in 2001
 \, with a degree in Biology. She returned to Birmingham to work in pharmace
 utical research until she entered Auburn University College of Veterinary M
 edicine\; she graduated Summa Cum Laude with her Doctorate of Veterinary Me
 dicine in 2009. </b></strong></p><p><strong><b>She was soon employed at Bri
 arcliff Animal Hospital until 2014\, when she joined the San Jose Beauclerc
 /Deerwood hospitals\, where she practiced until her death. </b></strong></p
 ><p><strong><b>Brooke was serving as the President of the Jacksonville Vete
 rinary Medical Society at the time of her passing. She was an active member
  of the American Association of Feline Practitioners\, the Florida Veterina
 ry Medical Association\, and the American Veterinary Medical Association. <
 /b></strong></p><p><strong><b><br></b></strong></p><p><strong><b>Brooke was
  also an avid supporter of rescue and shelter endeavors\, and was especiall
 y active with G.R.E.A.T. Rescue of NE Florida. A great deal of her “free” t
 ime was spent caring for disabled\, orphaned\, injured\, or behaviorally ch
 allenged animals. She tirelessly promoted responsible pet stewardship\, pre
 ventive care\, and she was outstanding in her medical skills with special g
 ifts in cardiology\, behavior\, pediatrics\, dentistry\, and preventive car
 e. </b></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><b><a href="mailto:bdangelfund@gm
 ail.com" target="_blank">bdangelfund@gmail.com</a></b></strong></p><p><stro
 ng><b><br></b></strong></p><p><a href="https://brookedavisangelfund.org/dr-
 jennifer-brooke-davis" target="_blank">https://brookedavisangelfund.org/dr-
 jennifer-brooke-davis</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href="https://www.facebook.co
 m/BrookeDavisAngelFund" target="_blank">https://www.facebook.com/BrookeDavi
 sAngelFund</a></p><p><br></p><p><a href="https://www.instagram.com/brookeda
 visangelfund/" target="_blank">https://www.instagram.com/brookedavisangelfu
 nd/</a></p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20251113T205955Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Brooke Davis Angel Fund (BDAF) Bingo Fundraiser
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
