 \nCup O' Joe is an easy-drinking\, dark\, medium-bodied OATMEAL STOUT infus
 ed with roasted COFFEE during the conditioning stage.\n\nThe coffee is from
  our friends over at Social Grounds Coffee Roasters☕❤️ - Oorah - Semper Fi!
 \n\nCup O' Joe is also BREWED (pun intended!) with 8 different types of GRA
 IN and balanced with a healthy dose of HOPS.\n\nCup O’ Joe has a RICH\, com
 plex flavor that ends with a nice SILKY FINISH!\n\nYum!😺\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
