DESCRIPTION:<p>Goal is to bring in 30 people.</p><p>The Muster is a relaxed
 \, veteran-centered social gathering held at restaurants\, breweries\, pubs
 \, coffee shops and other community-minded local businesses.</p><p>Our goal
  is to build long-term partnerships with venues that want to support vetera
 ns while also bringing people into their space. These events are designed t
 o serve veterans and the broader community by giving people a place to reco
 nnect\, meet others\, and build lasting camaraderie beyond the uniform.</p>
LAST-MODIFIED:20260908T125539Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Taproom: The Veterans Phalanx Muster Event
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
