 ️ - Oorah - Semper Fi!\n\nCup O&#39\; Joe is also BREWED (pun intended!) wi
 th 8 different types of GRAIN and balanced with a healthy dose of HOPS.\n\n
 Cup O’ Joe has a RICH\, complex flavor that ends with a nice SILKY FINISH!\
 n\nYum!😺\n\nAvailable in the taproom on Tuesday on draft and COMING SOON i
 n limited-release 6-packs!\n\nSlàinte! 🍻
